# Meshy AI API key — create one at https://www.meshy.ai (Settings → API Keys).
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY: used by scripts/meshy/generate.mjs. Do NOT rename it with a
# VITE_ prefix — anything VITE_* is bundled into the browser build and would leak
# the key. Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key below.
MESHY_API_KEY=
